<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2055553645"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1822904392"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Fireworks"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MindaRyn"/><amll:meta key="album" value="SURVIVE"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:42.380"><div begin="00:44.090" end="04:42.400"><p begin="00:44.090" end="00:51.910" itunes:key="L1">Please, let me go before it's too late<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请放开我的手</span></p><p begin="00:51.910" end="00:59.430" itunes:key="L2">Don't let me fall in the depth of your chest<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要让我坠入</span></p><p begin="00:59.430" end="01:07.220" itunes:key="L3">Still, we don't know what's hiding inside us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们仍然不知道</span></p><p begin="01:07.220" end="01:14.980" itunes:key="L4">Please, let me go before I fall in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请放开我的手</span></p><p begin="01:47.540" end="01:54.810" itunes:key="L5">Letters, secrets<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">书信 秘密</span></p><p begin="01:54.810" end="02:02.080" itunes:key="L6">Between you and me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">萦绕在你我之间</span></p><p begin="02:02.080" end="02:09.040" itunes:key="L7">Like feathers, feathers<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好似轻盈的羽毛</span></p><p begin="02:09.040" end="02:17.050" itunes:key="L8">How it would be if nothing ties our will<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倘若我们的意志没有被束缚</span></p><p begin="02:17.050" end="02:25.070" itunes:key="L9">When I look into your eyes, I see the grey<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我注视着你的眼睛</span></p><p begin="02:25.070" end="02:32.420" itunes:key="L10">I see the lies that covers your smile<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道谎言</span></p><p begin="02:32.420" end="02:40.230" itunes:key="L11">When you look into my eyes, do you feel the same?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你注视着我的眼睛</span></p><p begin="02:40.230" end="02:49.060" itunes:key="L12">Do you see the lies that covers my pain?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否明白谎言</span></p><p begin="02:49.060" end="02:52.620" itunes:key="L13">Your hand, my hand<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的手 我的手</span></p><p begin="02:52.620" end="03:01.460" itunes:key="L14">I feel you closer, slowly touching<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感觉你靠近我身边</span></p><p begin="03:01.460" end="03:09.240" itunes:key="L15">Please, let me go before it's too late<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请放开我的手</span></p><p begin="03:09.240" end="03:16.990" itunes:key="L16">Don't let me fall in the depth of your chest<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要让我坠入</span></p><p begin="03:16.990" end="03:24.730" itunes:key="L17">Still, we don't know what's hiding inside us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们仍然不知道</span></p><p begin="03:24.730" end="03:31.950" itunes:key="L18">Please, let me go before I fall in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请放开我的手</span></p><p begin="03:31.950" end="03:36.440" itunes:key="L19">I don't know what I'm saying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道我在说什么</span></p><p begin="03:36.440" end="03:44.150" itunes:key="L20">It can't be stopped, this heart is racing so fast<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却无法克制自己</span></p><p begin="03:44.150" end="03:51.830" itunes:key="L21">Please, let me fall, yes, please, let me fall<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请让我渐渐坠落</span></p><p begin="03:51.830" end="03:54.960" itunes:key="L22">And let me go before I fall in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我离开吧</span></p><p begin="03:54.960" end="03:59.840" itunes:key="L23">Hmm, before I fall in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我坠入爱河之前</span></p><p begin="04:42.200" end="04:42.400" itunes:key="L24">Whoa, whoa, whoa</p></div></body></tt>